        "content_type": "heading",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "## 解释武曲福德金星三",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000348-p000-7d2ef0a30d",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "兑卦对应武曲这一颗金星，安葬之后，墓主家族中会有人做到王陵级别的上卿官职。独自辅佐汉家王朝，谁敢与之匹敌？就像一座独木成山的高山，母亲会因自身原因而遭受刑罚。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000349-p000-0c37679ceb",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "武曲星的山势高大，水又绵长，最多能带来金银财帛和田地庄园。墓主家族三代都会出身为名将，这是因为丁山方位有长长的水来朝。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000350-p000-5b36fd9efd",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "兑山如果没有山头，哪里还能有墓道？但远处有朝砂和水，足以让家产盈余。如果武曲星突然高高照临，坎卦中的五鬼煞气自然就会消除。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000351-p000-299101ee37",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "武曲星重重叠叠地耸立起秀丽的山峰，横着来的财帛会让儿孙富裕。就像月宫中的丹桂连根折断，更会生出英雄人物，武艺出众超群。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000352-p000-f08c52856d",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "巽山如果没有足部（指山势根基）也难以行走，必须朝向蛇头方向斩断其精气。不要让龙脉与蛇脉相接迎接，这个方位安葬会不得安宁。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000353-p000-99f9ece8f5",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "巽山在辰、巳方位里头藏有气脉，天医天卦正是对应这里。如果有大水从生气位流来，子孙的财帛自然会盈满囊中。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000354-p000-f1e0c17d2b",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "巽家原本见到坎家会有凶险，因为坎家与巽家本不相同。天上六龙临墓绝，其家应少白头翁。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000355-p000-84d7afc9a9",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "坤、艮两位是逆情的方位，灾祸会波及自身，母亲会自受刑罚。如果还有一座山像阴贼一样到来，必须担忧会有刀下流血腥腥的惨事。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000356-p000-17bff9f7b9",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "震、巽比邻如同兄弟，不要说其他卦位禄存星。这是开辟的伏羲女娲祖先，至今富贵且兴旺人丁。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000357-p000-052e88a9e1",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "震山位秀丽重重叠起，富贵须知在此地相逢。不要把此山当作五鬼，须知变化中有真龙。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000358-p000-84907da108",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "兑方重逢水口朝来，高宜高大入云霄。贪狼、武曲星齐临照，西兑由此兴旺六朝。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000359-p000-4780c35adf",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "巨门星高大出英贤，高第神童寿命延长。山势若来长又远，年年进益横来钱。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000360-p000-3527a7af5a",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "一颗金星上起来冈，石氏当年葬祖场。又有贪狼流水出，合流西去出丁方。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000361-p000-0c05de74d0",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "破军福德一般平，进禄添财福更增。绝命若高遭毒药，瘟癀徒死坏家声。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000362-p000-9560391624",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "阴山齐起出英雄，昔日黄巢葬祖宗。二十万军心一片，忽然战败走西东。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000363-p000-81aedb1c13",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "阳山齐起号金龙，时暂收他太乙宫。无奈廉贞多叛逆，此山天上号狂龙。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000364-p000-cea0e6069f",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "heading",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "## 解释廉贞五鬼火星三",
